gn: center; color: #34D399; font-weight: 800;\">29:54<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #E2E8F0;\">58:52<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #C4B5FD;\">57:34<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Porto de Leix\u00f5es 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Porto de Leix\u00f5es 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica vila costeira de <strong>Le\u00e7a da Palmeira<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Matosinhos<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Trata-se de uma coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o entre a <strong>APDL (Administra\u00e7\u00e3o dos Portos do Douro, Leix\u00f5es e Viana do Castelo)<\/strong>, a <strong>Eventsport<\/strong> e o <strong>Centro de Cultura e Desporto da APDL<\/strong>, contando com o apoio institucional do Munic\u00edpio de Matosinhos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada junto ao hist\u00f3rico <strong>Forte de Nossa Senhora das Neves<\/strong> em Le\u00e7a da Palmeira, a prova arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> com a veloz <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada e a popular <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado proporciona a experi\u00eancia singular de correr dentro da \u00e1rea restrita do maior porto mar\u00edtimo do norte do pa\u00eds, em circuito 100% plano com vista para os navios e o Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; backg